---
// The wrap → hold → unwrap lifecycle, with what each step makes public.
---
<figure class="dg not-content">
  <ol class="dg-row">
    <li class="dg-card dg-card--public">
      <span class="dg-zone">Public</span>
      <p class="dg-title"><span class="dg-num">1</span>Wrap</p>
      <p class="dg-tokens"><span class="dg-tok">NIGHT</span><span class="dg-to" aria-label="becomes">→</span><span class="dg-tok dg-tok--s">sNIGHT</span></p>
      <dl class="dg-vis">
        <div><dt>Visible</dt><dd>Your address, amount</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Hidden</dt><dd>Who receives it</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </li>
    <li class="dg-card dg-card--shielded">
      <span class="dg-zone">Shielded</span>
      <p class="dg-title"><span class="dg-num">2</span>Hold &amp; send</p>
      <p class="dg-tokens"><span class="dg-tok dg-tok--s">sNIGHT</span><span class="dg-to" aria-label="sent to">→</span><span class="dg-tok dg-tok--s">sNIGHT</span></p>
      <dl class="dg-vis">
        <div><dt>Visible</dt><dd>Fee and time only</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Hidden</dt><dd>Sender, recipient, amount, balance</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </li>
    <li class="dg-card dg-card--public">
      <span class="dg-zone">Public</span>
      <p class="dg-title"><span class="dg-num">3</span>Unwrap</p>
      <p class="dg-tokens"><span class="dg-tok dg-tok--s">sNIGHT</span><span class="dg-to" aria-label="becomes">→</span><span class="dg-tok">NIGHT</span></p>
      <dl class="dg-vis">
        <div><dt>Visible</dt><dd>Recipient, amount</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Hidden</dt><dd>Whose sNIGHT paid</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>Entering and leaving the pool is public. Everything in between is shielded.</figcaption>
</figure>
